        {
          "text": "Lino kakuli bantu bone basicinsenda ibakakede kumulyango wamunzi. Bakaamba umwi aumwi kumweenzinyina kuti, Ino tukalilanzi okuno mane tukafwe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.3",
