        {
          "text": "Nkaambo Mwami wakacita kuti basilumamba ba-Aramu baswiilile kuyoba kwankalaki akwamabbiza akuyoba kwampi impati, aboobo bakaamba umwi aumwi kumweenzinyina kuti, Bona! Mwami wa-Israyeli watamba bami baba-Hiti abami baEgepita kuti bazoomugwasye kutulwisya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.6",
