        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo bakaamba umwi aumwi kumweenzinyina kuti, Teetwacita kabotu pe, Buzuba obuno mbuzuba bwamakani mabotu. Na twaumuna akulindila mane bukace tuyoojana mulandu, Amubuke, tweende kuyooambila basiŋanda bamwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino bakaya, baita basikulindila mulyango wamunzi, babalwiida kuti, Twasika kuzilao zyaba-Aramu, pele katakwe muntu nkuko niliba ijwi limvwigwa. Twajana mabbiza aangidwe ambongolo ziangidwe azilao zisiidwe mbuzibede. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo basikulindila mulyango bakaita, balwiida basiŋanda bamwami mukati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela mwami wakabuka masiku, waambila balanda bakwe kuti, Amuswiilile! Ndamwaambila ba-Aramu mbubatucitila. Balizi kuti twafwa inzala, aboobo bazwa muzilao kuyooyuba musokwe, nkaambo balayeeya kuti, Bazwa buyo mumunzi tuyoobajata bacili baumi akuzunda munzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
