              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino umwi wabalanda bakwe wakavuwa kuti, Atubweze mabbiza osanwe akati kayaayo aacisyeede. (Nkaambo ayo asyaala ayooba mbubonya mbuli makamu aabantu ba-Israyeli bafwide kale), Atutume, tukabone makani mbwaabede. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo bakabweza basimabbiza bobile, nkabela mwami wakabatuma kuyootobela basilumamba baba-Aramu, wati, Kamuya, mukabone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino bakabatobela mane kusikila ku-Jordano, nkabela bakajana kuti moonse munzila mulizwiide zyakusama azibelesyo ba-Aramu nzibakasowa mukucija kwabo, Elyo batumwa bakapiluka, baambila mwami,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.15"
            ]
          }
        }
