        {
          "text": "Pele oyo silutwe mwami ngwa akali kuyaamina ajanza lyakwe, mwami wakamubika kuti kalanga mulyango, nkabela bantu bakamulyataula omo mumulyango mane wafwa, mbubonya mbuli ijwi lyamuntu wa-Leza ndyaakaamba ciindi eco mwami naakeza kumubona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
